     "after": "Partial sums: 1/2, 3/4, 7/8, 15/16, …\nEach is 1 − (1/2)ⁿ: the gap to 1 halves each time.\nSo the sum approaches 1. (Not ∞: the terms shrink fast enough.)",
     "ref": "Activity 1.8 ii",
     "id": "g12.maths.u1.s1-4-1.10",
     "best": "1"
