    {
     "kind": "read",
     "step": "read",
     "title": "Infinite series",
     "paras": [
      "a₁ + a₂ + a₃ + … is an infinite series.",
      "It converges if Sₙ tends to a real number s. Then ∑ aₙ = s.",
